Bonjour Name Data v1

The artifact was derived from a separately maintained corpus assembled
primarily from public data and subsequently cleaned, aggregated, and
quantized.

This package contains no original source rows or name strings. It
contains a hash-based index and coarse statistical metadata derived from
the reworked corpus.

